MAYOR OF MADIUN

EAST JAVA PROVINCE

COPY

REGIONAL REGULATION OF MADIUN CITY

NUMBER 9 OF 2015

CONCERNING

IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

MAYOR OF MADIUN,

Considering : a. that violence against women and children constitutes a form of violation of human rights based on Pancasila and

the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

b. that acts of violence against women and children will have prolonged physical, psychological, sexual, social and economic impacts, thus requiring the provision of security and protection;

c. that at present there is no Regional Regulation that guarantees protection for women and children victims of violence in Madiun City;

d. that based on the considerations referred to in letters a, b, and c, it is necessary to stipulate a Regional Regulation concerning

Implementation of Protection for Women and Children

Victims of Violence;

In view of : 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;

2. Law Number 16 of 1950 concerning the Establishment of Large City Regions Within

the Provinces of East Java, Central Java, West

Java and the Special Region of Yogyakarta (State Gazette

of the Republic of Indonesia of 1950 Number 45);

3. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235) as amended by Law Number 35 of 2014 concerning Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5606);

4. Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning the Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4844);

5. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587) as amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning the Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);

6. Government Regulation Number 49 of 1982 concerning Amendment to the Territorial Boundaries of the Level II Municipality of Madiun (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1982 Number 76, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3244);

7. Presidential Regulation Number 18 of 2014 concerning Protection and Empowerment of Women and Children in Social Conflict;

8. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 1 of 2010 concerning Minimum Service Standards for Integrated Services for Women and Children Victims of Violence;

9. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 2 of 2011 concerning

Guidelines for Handling Children Victims of Violence;

10. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 19 of 2011 concerning Guidelines for Empowerment of Women Victims of

Violence;

11. Regional Regulation of East Java Province Number 16 of 2012 concerning Implementation of Protection

for Women and Children Victims of Violence (Regional

Gazette of East Java Province of 2012

Number 3 Series D);

12. Regional Regulation of Madiun City Number 02 of 2009 concerning Civil Service Investigators within the Madiun City Government (Regional Gazette of Madiun

City of 2009 Number 1/E);

With Joint Approval

REGIONAL HOUSE OF REPRESENTATIVES OF MADIUN CITY and

